WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:11.633
Install rostok with one Deno command

2
00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:21.266
Run rostok in an empty folder: a short wizard starts

3
00:00:21.266 --> 00:00:35.266
Tell it about your server: SSH address, domain and email

4
00:00:35.266 --> 00:00:44.132
Press Enter to keep the defaults for the rest

5
00:00:44.132 --> 00:00:52.965
Pick services from the catalog: Traefik for HTTPS, and OmniTools

6
00:00:52.965 --> 00:01:03.698
The project is written: one folder per server, with its settings

7
00:01:03.698 --> 00:01:13.698
Deploy: rostok copies the files to the server and starts them

8
00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:18.531
50 s later (cut short here), the deploy is done

9
00:01:18.531 --> 00:01:22.697
OmniTools is live on its own address, with HTTPS

10
00:01:22.697 --> 00:01:30.130
Search its tools and open the QR code generator

11
00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:41.330
Type a link, and the QR code follows as you type
